INT. DRAGON DENTIST'S WAITING CAVE - DAY

A vaulted cavern lined with velvet chairs scaled for giants. A rack of tattered magazines titled "Hoard Digest." A wall plaque: DR. SMOLDER, D.D.S. PAINLESS (FOR YOU).

PERPETUA THORNE, 40s, a knight in battered plate, sits on a chair far too large, feet dangling. She clutches a gauntlet in her lap and stares at the cavern ceiling.

GRIMBALD, 60s, a very small, very old gnome with a clipboard and spectacles, bustles from a door at the rear.

GRIMBALD
Dame Perpetua?

PERPETUA
That's me.

GRIMBALD
The doctor will see you now.

PERPETUA
Is it going to hurt?

GRIMBALD
Dame Perpetua, you slew a basilisk last spring.

PERPETUA
Yes.

GRIMBALD
Surely you can manage a cavity.

PERPETUA
A basilisk has no drill.

GRIMBALD
That is true.

She stands. Her armor clanks. She follows him down a corridor of glowing crystal, toward an immense, steaming doorway.

PERPETUA
Grimbald?

GRIMBALD
Yes, Dame?

PERPETUA
How many knights have you walked through here?

GRIMBALD
Seven hundred and twelve.

PERPETUA
How many came out?

GRIMBALD
All of them.

PERPETUA
Really?

GRIMBALD
Some with fewer teeth.

He pauses at the doorway and pats her hand, which barely reaches his shoulder.

GRIMBALD (CONT'D)
But everyone leaves smiling.

A great rumble from within. The floor trembles.

PERPETUA
(whispering)
That sounded hungry.

GRIMBALD
(whispering)
That is just the doctor's professional stomach.

PERPETUA
Grimbald, I may faint.

GRIMBALD
Dame Perpetua, I will faint with you.

She squares her shoulders. Takes a breath.

PERPETUA
Then lead on, small friend.

He opens the door. Steam rolls out in a warm, mint-scented wave. She walks into it, chin up, clanking.

GRIMBALD
(calling after)
Open wide!

Her voice, from within, is nearly a squeak.

PERPETUA (O.S.)
Wider than that?
